OL,3,GNEWSATwo more charged over Armadale
OL,4,Ashooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged in connection
OL,7,Fwith a suspected shooting in West
OL,8,FLothian.
OL,10,FPolice were called to a property on
OL,11,FHarestanes Road in Armadale at about
OL,12,F11:50 on Saturday 12 September.
OL,14,FBilly Watson, 35, was found injured and
OL,15,Fdied at the scene.
OL,17,FA 29-year-old man and 44-year-old man
OL,18,Fare due to appear at Livingston Sheriff
OL,19,FCourt on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
